## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design cross-process plug-in architectures, security boundaries, and robust IPC in Android.

## Key Concepts

- android:isolatedProcess, AIDL IPC, plugin sandboxing
- dynamic module loading, plugin signing, host verification
- data modeling for metadata and capabilities, lifecycle commands
- test strategy: IPC contracts, rollback, performance, security fuzzing

